For fiscal 2025, the filing reports these comparable sales changes against the prior year: Old Navy Global 3%, Gap Global 6%, Banana Republic Global 3%, and Athleta Global down 9%. The Gap, Inc. overall was up 3%. [1]

In fiscal 2024, the figures were Old Navy Global 3%, Gap Global 4%, Banana Republic Global 1%, and Athleta Global flat, with the company overall at 3%. [1]

Gap Global and Banana Republic Global therefore improved from the prior year, Old Navy Global held steady, and Athleta Global declined. Comp Sales cover Company-operated stores and online sales, and exclude the franchise and licensing business. [2]